{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00662","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 凯安四章 一 · 张说","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 凯安四章 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瑟彼瑶爵，亚惟上公。\n室如屏气，门不容躬。\n礼殷其本，乐执其中。\n圣皇永慕，天地幽通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00662.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00662","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}